#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Naam"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Give this account a meaningful name that will be displayed."
msgstr "Gee hierdie rekening 'n betekenisvolle naam wat vertoon sal word."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Gebruikersnaam"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The username that will be used for authentication."
msgstr "Die gebruikersnaam wat vir verifikasie gebruik sal word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Wagwoord"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The password used for authentication."
msgstr "Die wagwoord wat vir stawing gebruik word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Password"
msgstr "Enable-wagwoord"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your Enable Password, if required."
msgstr "Jou Aktiveer-wagwoord, indien vereis."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Aktiveer toestel"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Ontmerk hierdie blokkie om rugsteuning van hierdie toestel te deaktiveer."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beskrywing"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device (will be used for config saving and SVN if no hostname is present in config)."
msgstr "Naam van hierdie toestel (sal gebruik word vir die stoor van konfigurasie en SVN as geen gasheernaam in die konfigurasie teenwoordig is nie)."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "IP-adres"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Dit is die IP-adres wat gebruik word om met die toestel te kommunikeer."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "TFTP-bediener"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Opsionele TFTP-bediener waarna hierdie toestel sy konfigurasie kopieer. Laat leeg om die globale TFTP-bediener-instelling te gebruik."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Gestoorde SSH-gasheersleutel"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Vergelyk hierdie gasheersleutel-algoritme en SHA-1-heksadesimale vingerafdruk met die toestel deur 'n betroubare kanaal. Vervang die pad hieronder op die bediener met die ooreenstemmende publieke gasheersleutellêer en voer uit: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Gebruik die toestelaksie om dit skoon te maak ná 'n wettige sleutelverandering."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Gids"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Dit is die relatiewe gidsstruktuur wat gebruik word om die konfigurasies te stoor."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Skeduletipe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Hoe gereeld om hierdie toestel te rugsteun. Daagliks met 'n Herhaal elke van 10 voer elke 10 dae 'n rugsteun uit; Maandeliks voer 'n werklike kalendermaand-rugsteun uit."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Herhaal elke"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Vir Daaglikse skedules, voer die rugsteun elke X dae weer uit. Vir Weeklikse skedules sonder spesifieke Dae van die week, voer dit elke X weke weer uit; sodra Dae van die week gekies is, loop die rugsteun elke week op daardie dae en is hierdie veld nie van toepassing nie."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Dae van die week"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Vir 'n Weeklikse skedule, die dag(e) van die week waarop die rugsteun elke week uitgevoer moet word. Laat leeg om eerder elke Herloop Elke weke uit te voer."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Maande van die jaar"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Vir 'n Maandelikse skedule, die maand(e) van die jaar waarin die rugsteun uitgevoer moet word."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Dae van die maand"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Vir 'n Maandelikse skedule, die dag(e) van die maand waarop die rugsteun uitgevoer moet word (Laaste = laaste dag van die maand)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Weke van maand"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Vir 'n Maandeliks op Dag-skedule, die week (weke) van die maand waarin die rugsteun uitgevoer moet word."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Dae van die week (Maandeliks)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Vir 'n Maandeliks op Dag-skedule, die weeksdag(e) om met die keuse van Weke van die maand te paar."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Device Type"
msgstr "Toesteltipe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose the type of device that the router is."
msgstr "Kies die tipe toestel wat die roeteerder is."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "Auto-Detect"
msgstr "Outo-bespeur"

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Connection Type"
msgstr "Verbindingstipe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Dit is die tipe verbinding wat gebruik word om met die toestel te kommunikeer."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Authentication Account"
msgstr "Stawingsrekening"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose an account to use to Login to the router"
msgstr "Kies 'n rekening om te gebruik om by die roeteerder aan te meld"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Geen"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default timeout"
msgstr "Verstek-uitteltyd"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to wait in seconds for a response"
msgstr "Verstek-wagtyd in sekondes vir 'n antwoord"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default sleep time"
msgstr "Verstek-slaaptyd"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to sleep in microseconds (1/1,000,000th of a second)"
msgstr "Verstek-slaaptyd in mikrosekondes (1/1,000,000ste van 'n sekonde)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume elevated"
msgstr "Aanvaar verhoogde regte"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box to assume this device is always elevated"
msgstr "Merk hierdie blokkie om aan te neem dat hierdie toestel altyd verhoogde regte het"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device type."
msgstr "Naam van hierdie toesteltipe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Username Prompt"
msgstr "Gebruikersnaamaansporing"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the username prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Dit is die gebruikersnaampor om by aanmelding te pas."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password Prompt"
msgstr "Wagwoordversoek"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the password prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Dit is die wagwoordpor om by aanmelding te pas."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Konfigurasielêer"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Dit is die standaardligging van die konfigurasielêer op die afgeleë toestel. Dit word vir die SCP- en SFTP-metode gebruik"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Kopieer TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Dit is die CLI-teks wat gebruik word om die rugsteun na die tftp-bediener te stuur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Vasvangopdrag"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Opsionele opdrag waarvan die uitvoer as die konfigurasie gestoor word, in plaas daarvan om dit na 'n TFTP-bediener te kopieer. Dit loop altyd oor SSH, ongeag die verbindingsoort, en die toestel het dan geen TFTP-bediener nodig nie. Laat leeg vir toestelle wat hul konfigurasie na TFTP kopieer. Voorbeeld vir MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Wys weergawe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Dit is die CLI-teks wat gebruik word om die huidige weergawe te vertoon."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Bevestigingsporboodskap"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Dit is die bevestigingsaanporing wat voor oordrag ooreen moet stem."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Bevestig"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Is daar 'n bevestigingsversoek vir die kopiëring van die konfigurasie?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Dwing bevestiging af"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Is daar 'n gedwonge bevestigingsversoek vir die kopiëring van die konfigurasie?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Kontroleer End in opstelling"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Kontroleer end in opstelling?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Enige toets-por"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Teks wat pas by 'n 'Press Any Key To Continue'-styl aanpor"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Na-aanmelding-aanporings"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Opsionele por-/reaksiepare wat reg ná aanmelding gestuur word, voor die kopieer-na-TFTP-opdrag, een per reël as por|reaksie. Die por word as 'n hoofletter-onsensitiewe gereelde uitdrukking teen die toesteluitvoer gepas (dus kan dit nie self | bevat nie, en hakies en ander spesiale karakters moet ontsnap word, bv. Save \\\\[y/n\\\\]), en die reaksie word gestuur soos getik, of gebruik <CR> om net 'n reëlterugkeer (carriage return) te stuur. 'n Reaksie word slegs gestuur sodra die por daarvan gesien is, óf in die antwoord op die vorige reaksie óf in latere uitvoer; anders word 'n waarskuwing in die logboek aangeteken en niks word gestuur nie. Hierdie word eerste beantwoord; die 'Any Key'-por hierbo word later beantwoord terwyl die toestel geaktiveer word, dus bereik 'n por wat hier beantwoord word nooit 'Any Key' nie. Voorbeeld: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Algemene instellings"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Aanbiedingsmodus"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Moet roeteerder-konfigurasies op die Konsole of 'n boonste oortjie vertoon word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Konsole"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Boonste Oortjie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Konfigurasie-diff-konteksreëls"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Die verstekaantal onveranderde reëls om voor en ná elke verandering te vertoon wanneer twee rugsteune vergelyk word. 'n Groter waarde maak dit makliker om die omliggende konfigurasiekonteks te sien. Dit kan per vergelyking op die Vergelyk-bladsy oorheers word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Verbindingstydverstryking"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Maksimum wagtyd in sekondes wanneer die aanvanklike netwerkverbinding na 'n toestel opgestel word. 'n Vasgehaakte of onbereikbare toestel word na hierdie uitteltyd laat vaar sodat 'n geskeduleerde rugsteunlopie met die oorblywende toestelle kan voortgaan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Sluit sonder om af te sluit"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Indien gemerk, word geen 'exit'-opdrag uitgereik wanneer die toestelverbinding gesluit word nie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Ontfout-verbindingsbuffer"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Of direkte afvoer van die toestelverbinding aangeteken moet word"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Aanvaar alle toestelle het verhoogde regte"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Of aangeneem moet word dat alle toestelle verhoogde regte het"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Aflaai-uur"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Die uur van die dag waarop die volledige aflaaie uitgevoer word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Herpogingskedule"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Die tyd om te wag voordat 'n bykomende aflaai gepoog word wanneer 'n geskeduleerde aflaai misluk"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Behoudtydperk"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Die aantal dae om ou rugsteune te behou."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Behou rugsteune van onaktiewe toestelle"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, sal die retensie-opruiming nie verouderde rugsteune skrap wat aan gedeaktiveerde toestelle of toestelle wat verwyder is behoort nie, sodat konfigurasies vir uitdiensgestelde of onbereikbare toerusting behou word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Oordragopsies"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Verstek-verbindingstipe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Verstek tipe verbinding wat gebruik word om met die toestel te kommunikeer."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Skei volgens Toestel"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "Skei geargiveerde Konfigurasies in 'n gids per toestel"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Gedateerde subgids"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Voeg 'n datumgebaseerde subgids in die argiefpad in (voor die gids per toestel), sodat elke lopie onder sy rugsteundatum gestoor word, bv. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Af behou die bestaande uitleg."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "SCP-pad"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
msgstr "Wanneer SCP gebruik word en jy hierdie leeg laat, sal PHP se SCP-module gebruik word, wat nie altyd werk nie. Eksterne SCP is gedeaktiveer terwyl SSH-gasheersleutelverifikasie geaktiveer is omdat dit nie die geverifieerde verbinding kan hergebruik nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Verifieer SSH-gasheersleutels"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Record each device's SSH host key on first connect and refuse to send credentials if it later changes. SSH/Telnet mode will not fall back to Telnet while verification is enabled. After a legitimate key change, use the device action to clear the stored host key."
msgstr "Teken elke toestel se SSH-gasheersleutel by die eerste verbinding aan en weier om aanmeldbesonderhede te stuur as dit later verander. SSH/Telnet-modus sal nie na Telnet terugval terwyl verifikasie geaktiveer is nie. Na 'n geldige sleutelverandering, gebruik die toestelaksie om die gestoorde gasheersleutel skoon te maak."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "TFTP Server IP"
msgstr "TFTP-bediener-IP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Must be an IP pointing to your Cacti server."
msgstr "Moet 'n IP wees wat na u Cacti-bediener wys."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "TFTP Backup Directory Path"
msgstr "TFTP-rugsteungidspad"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The path to where your Configs will be backed up, it must be the path that the local TFTP Server writes to."
msgstr "Die pad waarheen u konfigurasies gerugsteun sal word; dit moet die pad wees waarheen die plaaslike TFTP-bediener skryf."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Archive Directory Path"
msgstr "Argiefgids-pad"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The path to where your Configs will be archived (moved from TFTP directory)"
msgstr "Die pad waarheen u konfigurasies geargiveer sal word (verskuif vanaf TFTP-gids)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Email Options"
msgstr "E-posopsies"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "From Address"
msgstr "Van-adres"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Email address the nightly backup will be sent from."
msgstr "E-posadres waarvandaan die nagtelike rugsteun gestuur sal word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Van-naam"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name the nightly backup will be sent from."
