#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Config Diffs"
msgstr "Sluit Konfigurasieverskille in"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Append a unified diff of each device whose configuration changed during the run to the backup Email, so a reviewer can see exactly what changed. Binary (non-text) configurations are skipped. Volatile lines that change on every backup (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' and 'Current configuration :', and NX-OS '!Time:' and '!Running configuration last done at:') are always ignored. Warning: the diff is sent in clear text to every recipient of the Email, so it can reveal configuration that should stay private; leave Include Secrets in Diffs unchecked."
msgstr "Heg 'n verenigde verskil (unified diff) van elke toestel waarvan die konfigurasie tydens die lopie verander het, aan die rugsteun-E-pos aan sodat 'n beoordelaar presies kan sien wat verander het. Binêre (nie-teks) konfigurasies word oorgeslaan. Vlugtige reëls wat by elke rugsteun verander (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' en 'Current configuration :', en NX-OS '!Time:' en '!Running configuration last done at:') word altyd geïgnoreer. Waarskuwing: die verskil word in duidelike teks aan elke ontvanger van die E-pos gestuur, dus kan dit konfigurasie openbaar wat privaat moet bly; laat 'Sluit geheime in verskille in' ongemerk."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Secrets in Diffs"
msgstr "Sluit Geheime in Verskille in"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Send secret values in the emailed diff as they are. When unchecked (the default), the changed lines are found on the raw configurations and printed redacted, failing closed: lines containing secret-like words (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) and SNMP host and user lines are reduced to their first word followed by &lt;secret hidden&gt;, and every line of a PEM block, a certificate or key-string block, or a multi-line quoted value, and any hex or base64 row, is hidden; a block that never ends hides the rest of the configuration. This also hides harmless lines (e.g. a description mentioning a key), but every changed line still shows up, marked (changed) when only its hidden part differs, and a block that never ends is noted in the Email. Stored backups are never changed."
msgstr "Stuur geheime waardes in die ge-e-poste diff soos hulle is. Wanneer dit nie gemerk is nie (die verstek), word die veranderde reëls op die rou konfigurasies gevind en geredigeerd gedruk, wat veilig faal: reëls wat geheim-agtige woorde bevat (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) en SNMP-gasheer- en -gebruikerreëls word verkort tot hul eerste woord gevolg deur &lt;secret hidden&gt;, en elke reël van 'n PEM-blok, 'n sertifikaat- of sleutelstringblok, of 'n meerreëlige aangehaalde waarde, en enige heks- of base64-ry, word versteek; 'n blok wat nooit eindig nie, versteek die res van die konfigurasie. Dit versteek ook onskadelike reëls (bv. 'n beskrywing wat 'n sleutel noem), maar elke veranderde reël verskyn steeds, gemerk as (changed) wanneer slegs sy versteekte deel verskil, en 'n blok wat nooit eindig nie, word in die E-pos vermeld. Gestoorde rugsteune word nooit verander nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Diff Exclude Patterns"
msgstr "Diff-uitsluitingspatrone"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional regular expressions (one per line) matching configuration lines to ignore when comparing, so volatile lines such as timestamps or serial numbers do not show up as changes. Each pattern is matched case-insensitively anywhere in a line unless anchored with ^ or $; a pattern that is not a valid regular expression is ignored."
msgstr "Opsionele gereelde uitdrukkings (een per reël) wat konfigurasiereëls pas wat by vergelyking geïgnoreer moet word, sodat vlugtige reëls soos tydstempels of reeksnommers nie as veranderinge wys nie. Elke patroon word hoofletter-onsensitief enige plek in 'n reël gepas tensy dit met ^ of $ geanker is; 'n patroon wat nie 'n geldige gereelde uitdrukking is nie, word geïgnoreer."

